advanced-step-loading	progression	Advanced lifters (> 24 months training, experience_level: advanced) operate near their genetic ceiling. Weekly weight increases are explicitly prohibited. Enforce step-loading: have the user hold the same load for multiple sessions until the effort feels manageable (RPE drops from 8 to 6–7 at the same weight), then authorize a micro-increment of 1–2.5 kg. When current load is within 5 kg of the user's personal record, restrict any increment to 1–2.5 kg maximum — aggressive jumps near PR carry exponentially higher connective tissue injury risk.	[0.002634371,0.04208889,-0.006104141,-0.06836008,0.008298052,-0.0074702394,0.010874561,-0.005028718,0.003571089,0.008657798,-0.0087574255,0.008688412,0.017964507,0.007586028,0.11641383,0.028962793,0.03026102,0.0051883394,0.01352948,-0.00990693,-0.014867428,-0.0024530038,-0.024334077,-0.01755307,0.009848305,-0.010959662,0.0048372927,0.011000723,0.079211794,0.0033391037,-0.01211033,-0.006945659,0.008802729,0.029412657,-0.007493313,0.015112012,0.0024595202,-0.030000214,0.00045288578,0.01728468,-0.011538526,0.026101604,0.037706073,-0.0029344968,-0.01618466,0.014958616,0.0014983704,-0.0137492195,-0.014503826,0.023414766,0.0070255534,0.001226201,-0.014489701,-0.15841974,0.02895446,0.013386351,0.01924357,0.0075304317,0.0033626829,-0.0116790235,-0.026047736,0.030659154,0.028345322,0.01663172,0.00784175,0.0011015406,0.027019085,-0.001494736,-0.028881872,-0.028229173,-0.016928898,-0.030754542,0.014303296,0.0013117298,0.005897322,-0.012365563,-0.002868665,0.018446794,-0.010146151,-0.005527656,-0.0025699446,-0.031488106,0.00041450266,-0.009388296,-0.018284164,-0.010152484,-0.0024217286,0.0042278375,0.01633909,0.011948481,0.016113108,0.014787341,0.009060118,-0.0024228957,-0.005470831,-0.001231907,0.019213656,-0.013786971,0.026110534,-0.021260986,-0.014217084,-0.015295332,0.018635593,-0.012958304,-0.012317852,0.012456495,-0.01466895,-0.017103838,0.023480719,0.02015671,-0.024624614,-0.005474375,0.0104970485,