data-sparsity-calibration	progression	When an exercise has fewer than 3 completed sessions in the database, the system is in calibration mode. Restrict progression suggestions to a maximum 2–3% weight increase (rounded to nearest 2.5 kg). Include "Insufficient history — system is calibrating this exercise baseline" in the evidence array. Do not suggest complex set/rep manipulations during calibration. Conservative loading during the calibration phase prevents ingraining flawed motor patterns before a baseline is established.	[-0.0006601512,0.026039459,0.0065013506,-0.042811,0.0058207614,-0.006429463,-0.012804049,-0.027924351,0.009959664,0.014961498,-0.024108712,-0.00072349544,-0.014202866,0.022506436,0.12733328,0.03960772,0.034530103,0.000892141,-0.002923256,-0.008087005,-0.009896393,0.00447169,-0.01947156,-0.008059258,0.009632157,-0.04437315,0.028519103,-8.7896864e-05,0.06831738,-0.005505973,0.006911365,0.014427666,0.03262564,0.02629697,0.0076160375,0.01843892,0.017727897,-0.02712067,0.02885178,0.023022119,-0.0068322374,0.013456519,0.024307756,-0.007394546,-0.039178517,0.028247342,-0.0010765765,-0.020071542,-0.021046316,0.015535636,-0.0075483136,-0.014357254,0.0004518506,-0.161774,-0.0027634804,-0.015650554,0.02321024,0.017451929,0.028823432,-0.0140186725,-0.020413604,0.047318548,-0.008680571,0.00824867,-0.010645265,-0.008734582,0.006115894,0.008574645,-0.036684535,-0.015046211,0.0013745838,-0.011695729,0.03415253,-0.020068122,0.016852647,-0.021484993,-0.002692102,0.016108014,0.0010997956,0.005245155,0.0033689276,-0.027454918,0.0028457867,0.0050195158,-0.017512005,-0.029559663,0.0012923394,0.016023953,0.041217655,0.0036581764,-0.012433233,0.0070581906,-0.0020964057,0.0074087186,-0.004987626,0.017784573,0.026855906,0.012027756,-0.002698804,-0.020357674,0.0070884437,0.013821992,0.00587942,-0.0073964144,-0.027095987,0.010266175,0.0062260274,-0.037556097,0.025849752,0.03240822,-0.0036858127,-0.018623468,0.009188823,0.0022639495,0.0011439032,-0.15605624,0.0012960435,0.0