rep-range-sticking-point	deload	If a user has stalled at the same absolute weight for more than 2 sessions but the stall has lasted fewer than 3 weeks (below the deload threshold), prescribe rep range expansion before attempting further weight increases. Example: if stuck at 80 kg × 8 reps, instruct the user to push for 80 kg × 10 reps across 1–2 sessions. Only after the expanded rep target is successfully achieved does the system authorize a weight increment. This micro-progression strategy builds a physiological bridge to the next load level without dangerous ego-driven max-out attempts.	[0.02834241,0.031545907,-0.014148052,-0.08642477,0.0005569455,-0.022987496,-0.0064363377,-0.025779743,0.001546881,-0.0103748785,-0.021807685,0.0026175373,0.00062008225,0.012590203,0.113091975,0.03015322,0.043107986,-0.0004770284,0.012361345,-0.015253762,-0.03383872,-0.002094998,-0.039589353,-0.004637538,0.0017717278,-0.028668402,0.002409437,0.012164336,0.061145548,-0.02304888,-0.011125882,-0.0012470684,0.0163956,0.01971117,-0.010837746,0.016072286,0.009401949,-0.026769754,0.02277613,0.028617064,-0.010371206,0.020251581,0.03181956,0.009237564,-0.033149507,-0.005794607,0.001872523,-0.029377388,-0.0074157743,0.03541756,-0.005383572,0.0036436955,-0.011137067,-0.16440336,0.010128738,-0.004516191,0.017261865,0.02312802,0.018009987,-0.021602625,-0.024712175,0.020516124,0.006235876,-0.013205612,-0.0041444795,-0.015604847,0.00080283906,0.009578476,-0.030538967,0.013556192,-0.007223975,-0.022797102,0.038611524,0.0053137615,-0.0013729772,-0.0062112166,-0.00062362547,0.027675372,0.0028337983,-0.02454385,0.0065747527,-0.022717485,0.005066565,0.00489472,-0.018392075,-0.013121655,-0.013553112,0.015070211,0.008270024,0.012742114,-0.024238037,0.02683725,-0.009540354,-0.001727126,-0.014100128,0.008602874,0.0096943155,0.0020376667,0.00866779,-0.01891662,0.0060235397,-0.01878134,-0.021076774,0.01499266,-0.01166578,0.011468639,-0.01630329,-0.032733314,0.009473774,0.0077335597,0.009338826,-0.016013756,