weak-point-diagnostics	specificity	A compound lift stalls almost universally due to a localized muscular deficiency at a specific kinetic chain position, not total-body weakness. Match accessory prescriptions to failure patterns: failing at chest on bench press → prescribe heavy dumbbell flies or incline press; failing at lockout on bench → prescribe JM press or loaded triceps extensions; failing at knee level on deadlift → prescribe Romanian deadlifts or leg curls; failing out of the hole on squat → prescribe pause squats or leg press with full range. Identify the failure point and prescribe the targeted accessory, not a generic accessory for that muscle.	[0.005018985,0.042238075,0.0052868156,-0.057758648,0.007880939,-0.018971393,0.010728539,-0.010336102,0.014058734,0.0017819853,-0.02344544,0.023760917,-0.018450975,0.014179367,0.11217618,0.024158493,0.04580791,0.013525879,0.0032916428,-0.020357385,-0.0129265,-0.011640463,-0.015456991,-0.01945989,-0.0019192033,-0.02511809,0.007478143,0.021299122,0.044293232,-0.025830196,0.014272297,0.011527546,0.007063421,0.014876294,0.021240925,0.025457546,0.008518313,-0.03981356,0.024527801,0.017896509,-0.0074145403,0.010794482,0.023384098,0.019561691,-0.023874722,-0.01817396,0.012738132,-0.014015092,-0.014918106,0.026073068,-0.012568605,0.009317355,-0.026850436,-0.17049511,0.014666804,0.003801185,0.022913756,0.01806548,0.015866898,-0.015272596,-0.023838364,0.034426462,-0.015102145,-0.02383151,-0.0022442683,-0.021603754,0.0057258136,0.010083526,-0.035460576,0.015473741,-0.009264021,-0.0255434,0.007960404,-0.016687457,0.004857153,-0.014538462,0.0051814346,0.03285342,-0.02372589,-0.009368952,-0.007959612,0.007291437,-0.010904341,0.017950637,-0.011630937,-0.01621084,-0.007292934,-0.005596112,0.014756202,0.0066599334,-0.005532566,0.015823424,0.02303818,0.009151367,-0.013263917,0.003449847,0.010094208,-0.026080288,0.010872757,-0.0068659023,0.0089459345,0.0058451826,0.017160747,-0.0063130003,-0.02906504,0.0029480963,-0.008922703,-0.0045